{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52863","headline":"送贺秘监归会稽诗 · 韦述","name":"送贺秘监归会稽诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二疏方告老，四皓尽归山。\n蔼蔼都门别，仍看衣锦还。\n霓裳标逸气，丹竈理童颜。\n一遇真仙侣，羣心难可攀。\n（见孔延之《会稽掇英总集》卷二）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦述","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52863.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52863","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}